{
  "id": "section-weapon-rules",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Weapon rules\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,247,260]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "All weapon rules are found in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,260,294]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Weapon Summary Table at the end\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,294,326]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of the book.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,326,339]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "There is no difference between a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,339,372]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ranged or melee weapon, except\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,372,403]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "for specific cases where you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,403,436]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "given special rules.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,436,457]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may pick up a stick every time\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,457,492]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you visit a park, or a kitchen knife\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,492,529]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "every time you visit a house.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,529,559]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may pick up weapons from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,559,588]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your slain foes. If they do not match\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,588,626]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "up perfectly with the weapons on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,626,659]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Weapon Summary Table, use\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,659,689]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the closest equivalent. Additional\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,689,724]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapons may be found during the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,724,756]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "game.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,756,762]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you have more than one weapon,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,762,796]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you may freely exchange them\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,796,825]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "before the combat. Changing a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,825,855]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapon during combat requires 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,855,887]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Action.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,887,895]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you run out of ammo during a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,895,927]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "combat, you must use 1 turn to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,927,958]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "draw another weapon (or, if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,958,990]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have a rifle, use it as a club).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,990,1023]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you throw a grenade, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1023,1053]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may hold another weapon in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1053,1084]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "other hand and use it on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1084,1113]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "following turn, without having to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1113,1147]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "spend a turn to draw it.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1147,1172]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Ammo for the various ranged\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1172,1200]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapons is NOT interchangeable.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1200,1232]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You must keep track of ammo use\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1232,1264]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "for each weapon. In most cases,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1264,1296]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you will have only one, so it’s not a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1296,1334]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "big deal.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1334,1344]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Ammo does not count as a carried\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1344,1377]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "item. Grenades count as a carried\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1377,1411]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "item. If you have more than one\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1411,1443]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "grenade, you carry them on a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1443,1472]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bandolier, and all you grenades\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1472,1504]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "count as a single carried item.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1504,1536]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Roll on this table at character creation to determine what weapon you have managed\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1536,1619]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-weapon-rules:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to find. You automatically have a knife or club/stick in addition to the weapon rolled.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[20,1619,1706]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    20
  ]
}
